# The Ruby lists MIR node CLASS OBJECTS here for its checker's reflection
# (OWNERSHIP_SIGNIFICANT_NODE_TYPES). CLEAR has no class objects, and a
# module-scope owned list has no lifetime to be freed in, so the lists are
# dropped; nothing in the CLEAR tree reads them.
EXTERN FN compilerInspectValue() RETURNS String EFFECTS :safe FROM "compiler_regex";
PUB UNION Alloc { SymbolValue: String@symbol, Emittable: Emittable }
